{"title":"Curricula","body":"<div style=\"background-color: #eef2f5; padding: 40px 10px; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\">\n    <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width: 620px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n\n\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7 0%, #2563eb 100%); padding: 35px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n                <img src=\"media/com_wmacommunication/images/logo-wma-email.png\" alt=\"WMA Software Development\" width=\"200\" style=\"display: block; border: 0; outline: none; background: transparent; padding: 10px 15px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\" />\n                <h1 style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 20px 0 0 0; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Nuova Candidatura / Messaggio</h1>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n\n\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 35px 40px;\">\n\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid #0284c7;\">\n                            <h2 style=\"font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #0284c7; margin: 0; letter-spacing: 1px; font-weight: 700;\">Dati Anagrafici</h2>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-bottom: 15px; vertical-align: top;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 3px;\">Titolo articolo</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">{Titolo articolo}</span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding-bottom: 15px; vertical-align: top;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 3px;\">URL pagina</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">{URL pagina}</span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-bottom: 15px; vertical-align: top;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 3px;\">Nome</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">{Nome}</span>\n                        </td>\n                        <td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-bottom: 15px; vertical-align: top;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 3px;\">Cognome</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">{Cognome}</span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-bottom: 15px; vertical-align: top;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 3px;\">Email</span>\n                            <a href=\"mailto:{Email}\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #2563eb; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;\">{Email}</a>\n                        </td>\n                        <td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-bottom: 15px; vertical-align: top;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 3px;\">Telefono</span>\n                            <a href=\"tel:{Telefono}\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;\">{Telefono}</a>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid #0284c7;\">\n                            <h2 style=\"font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #0284c7; margin: 0; letter-spacing: 1px; font-weight: 700;\">Dettagli Richiesta</h2>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 15px;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 3px;\">Oggetto</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 500;\">{Oggetto}</span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 15px;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 3px;\">Tipo di Candidatura</span>\n                            <span style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px;\">{Tipo di candidatura}</span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 15px;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 3px;\">Posizione Aperta</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">{Posizioni aperte}</span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 20px;\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 5px;\">Curriculum Vitae</span>\n                            <div style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 6px; display: inline-block;\">\n                                <span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #334155;\">📎 {Allega curriculum}</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 2px solid #0284c7;\">\n                            <h2 style=\"font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #0284c7; margin: 0; letter-spacing: 1px; font-weight: 700;\">Messaggio</h2>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n                <div style=\"background-color: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; padding: 15px 18px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #334155; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n                    {Messaggio}\n                </div>\n\n\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-align: right;\">\n                            Verifica hCaptcha: <strong>{hcaptcha}</strong>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </table>\n\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n\n\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; background-color: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; text-align: center;\">\n                Email generata automaticamente dal modulo di contatto <strong>WMA Software Development</strong>.\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </table>\n</div>"}
